2026-11-11 09:41:57,394 INFO mulder.orchestrator.display: [dashboard] ### ATTACK CHAIN COHERENCE ASSESSMENT
2026-11-11 09:41:57,395 INFO mulder.orchestrator.display: [dashboard] The original findings attempted to establish a kill chain:
2026-11-11 09:41:57,395 INFO mulder.orchestrator.display: [dashboard] - Discovery/Reconnaissance (network scanning tools, IRC access)
